---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/cases/event-discovery.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8_lossy(&run.get_output().stdout)"
---
instrukt.system.event.dead_lettered v1 — A persistently failing stream entry was parked in a dead letter destination. (subject: stream_entry, delivery: Occurrence)
  instrukt events schema instrukt.system.event.dead_lettered
runner.ci_completed v1 — The integrate candidate CI completed, including a no-CI observation. (subject: commit, delivery: State)
  instrukt events schema runner.ci_completed
runner.dependency_failing v1 — A check run on a current dependency-update head failed. (subject: commit, delivery: Occurrence)
  instrukt events schema runner.dependency_failing
runner.main_failing v1 — Remote canonical main head completed CI red. (subject: inbound_source, delivery: State)
  instrukt events schema runner.main_failing
runner.upstream_changed v1 — A watched upstream ref changed. (subject: inbound_source, delivery: State)
  instrukt events schema runner.upstream_changed
workflow.finalized v1 — A finalize-ready todo was handed off to integration. (subject: todo, delivery: Occurrence)
  instrukt events schema workflow.finalized
workflow.preparation_reviewed v1 — Reviewed preparation documentation is ready for immediate integration. (subject: todo, delivery: Occurrence)
  instrukt events schema workflow.preparation_reviewed
